      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "BLK_CH05_S01_A_01",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "content": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "text": "은서: “전부라고 말할 수는 없어요.”"
          },
          "speakerId": "CHAR_EUNSEO",
          "completionEffectIds": [],
          "source": {
            "sourceHash": "66e7358249200fd6624e03f7f818a9c1a0f434cb3ca032c3ef1c89b148fa7336",
            "sourcePath": "source/마지막_확인_전체_시나리오.md",
            "lineStart": 743,
            "lineEnd": 743,
            "stableBlockId": "SRC_CH05_S01_A_01"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "BLK_CH05_S01_A_02",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "content": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "text": "서진: “이미 밖으로 나온 게 있습니까?”"
          },
          "speakerId": "CHAR_SEOJIN",
          "completionEffectIds": [],
          "source": {
            "sourceHash": "66e7358249200fd6624e03f7f818a9c1a0f434cb3ca032c3ef1c89b148fa7336",
            "sourcePath": "source/마지막_확인_전체_시나리오.md",
            "lineStart": 745,
            "lineEnd": 745,
            "stableBlockId": "SRC_CH05_S01_A_02"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "BLK_CH05_S01_A_03",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "content": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "text": "은서: “그걸 아무 데서나 말하지 않으려고 거짓말한 겁니다.”"
          },
          "speakerId": "CHAR_EUNSEO",
          "completionEffectIds": [],
          "source": {
            "sourceHash": "66e7358249200fd6624e03f7f818a9c1a0f434cb3ca032c3ef1c89b148fa7336",
            "sourcePath": "source/마지막_확인_전체_시나리오.md",
            "lineStart": 747,
            "lineEnd": 747,
            "stableBlockId": "SRC_CH05_S01_A_03"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "BLK_CH05_S01_A_04",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "content": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "text": "서진: “당사자 이름은 가리고 보겠습니다.”"
          },
          "speakerId": "CHAR_SEOJIN",
          "completionEffectIds": [],
          "source": {
            "sourceHash": "66e7358249200fd6624e03f7f818a9c1a0f434cb3ca032c3ef1c89b148fa7336",
            "sourcePath": "source/마지막_확인_전체_시나리오.md",
            "lineStart": 749,
            "lineEnd": 749,
            "stableBlockId": "SRC_CH05_S01_A_04"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "BLK_CH05_S01_A_05",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "content": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "text": "은서: “그 약속은 기억할게요.”"
          },
          "speakerId": "CHAR_EUNSEO",
          "completionEffectIds": [
            "FX_REVEAL_NOTE_CH05_S01_A"
          ],
          "source": {
            "sourceHash": "66e7358249200fd6624e03f7f818a9c1a0f434cb3ca032c3ef1c89b148fa7336",
